Electron and Chromium
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ElecKoi Desktop is built with Electron, which is licensed under the MIT License
and embeds Chromium and Node.js. Packaged builds retain Electron's MIT license as
LICENSE.electron.txt and Chromium's component notices as LICENSES.chromium.html.

