GeckoView (Android compatibility variant)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Android compatibility variant bundles the unmodified Mozilla GeckoView
ARM64 artifact, version 158.0.20261007201254, under the Mozilla Public License
2.0 and the component-specific terms included by Mozilla. Exact artifact and
native library identities are recorded in apps/android/geckoview.lock.json.

Official artifact:
https://maven.mozilla.org/maven2/org/mozilla/geckoview/geckoview-arm64-v8a/158.0.20261007201254/
Corresponding source revision:
https://hg.mozilla.org/releases/mozilla-release/rev/eb9a6e3a736802c8e080a76c44dc81f409d99d54

The repository retains the full MPL 2.0 text, component notice and unmodified
upstream license document in apps/android/app/src/compat/assets/licenses/geckoview/.
Compatibility APKs distribute the same documents at:

- assets/licenses/geckoview/MPL-2.0.txt
- assets/licenses/geckoview/NOTICE.txt
